WEBVTT

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:13.310
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:12.880
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:18.040
<i>Overlooking the rows of houses and stores</i>

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:22.450
<i>from the highest vantage,</i>

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>Such things as tears and sadness</i>

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:31.700
<i>will quickly vanish</i>

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:37.260
<i>The birds, wind, and sunshine...</i>

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:41.450
<i>...all are your friends</i>

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:46.520
<i>I'll carry this dream farther than far</i>

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.610
<i>...no matter the distance...</i>

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:58.370
<i>I long to fly freely</i>

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.650
<i>through the blue sky in my heart...</i>

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>The far distant blue sky</i>

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:13.030
<i>It flows into tomorrow</i>

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:25.340
Takara Fansubs

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:33.830
<i>Alfredo was cleared of all guilt before the King.</i>

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:39.560
<i>But doing so exhausted what little life remained in him.</i>

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:43.350
<i>After uttering his last words to his best friend,</i>

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:49.350
<i>...Alfredo passed away in Romeo's arms.</i>

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:54.350
Episode 30:

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:54.350
The Last Promise

00:01:56.180 --> 00:02:00.120
Alfredo, where are you? Where?

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:02.040
Alfredo.

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:03.170
Romeo.

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:08.040
Please carry on for me... see and do the things I would have...

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:11.670
...the dreams I never...

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:16.920
The dreams you never what, Alfredo? You didn't finish.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:26.880
That's right... Alfredo's gone.

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:30.500
Alfredo!!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:35.810
<i>In the days that passed since that terrible morning,</i>

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:38.500
<i>...Romeo could hardly recollect his activities.</i>

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.470
<i>He felt as if he were in a mist.</i>

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:44.120
<i>His heart was overflowing with sorrow.</i>

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.890
What's with him?

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.390
Hey! Romeo!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.480
You're in bed all the time!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.440
Get up and get to work!

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.140
What gives with this kid?

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.850
Always with that same look on his face!

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:05.940
Let him alone.

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:06.960
What are you saying?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:14.120
A close friend of his was taken up to Heaven yesterday.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.960
You mean Alfredo?

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.260
Yes.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.970
How terrible.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:27.740
<i>The news was also reaching the other boys.</i>

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:33.630
What? You're kidding...
If you're lying, I'll kill you!

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:39.440
I wish it weren't true...
but he's... he's...

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:42.440
I...

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:44.730
I can't believe it...

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:46.920
I can't believe it!

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.760
Giovanni, you tell me:

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:08.800
Why... why did he have to die?
It isn't right!

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.760
It must be a mistake!

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.310
Somebody tell me!

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:21.080
Hey, Nikita!

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.950
No... it's not right...

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:46.100
Big brother, you said you wanted to see Mother and Father again...

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.450
Well, now you've gone running to meet them so far ahead of me.

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:55.730
But I won't sit around crying, big brother.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:59.300
I know you wouldn't like that.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:06.820
Wherever you might be...

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.920
You'll always be mine.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:29.450
We mustn't forget...

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:34.130
God has given us a priceless treasure in this burdensome life...

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:35.870
...Alfredo's spirit.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:41.030
Although in his heart it's now still,

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:46.490
...it continues to live on in his friends.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:53.790
Bianca.

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:59.650
I wish you understood how much I trust Romeo.

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:03.990
I really believe that I don't measure up to him.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:09.530
He doesn't realize how kind he himself is.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:14.640
Romeo is the only one who's truly brave.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:18.720
I'm sure you'll like him one day.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.880
Big brother... it's Romeo, isn't it.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:26.870
He's the one who's going to carry on for you.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:52.260
Why? How could you have gone to a place where you and I can't even talk?

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.000
I'm alone now.

00:06:55.770 --> 00:07:02.650
Please come back, Alfredo.

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:22.680
Romeo! I've been looking for you all day! I really need to see you.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:28.900
It's the first time I've ever felt down like this... surprised?

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.040
I know what you'll tell me:

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:38.110
"Don't let it get you down!"... right?

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:45.120
Gimme a good whack... right here.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:49.530
I don't have the energy.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:53.740
Romeo!

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:58.150
Come to the secret base!
Everyone's waiting.

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:00.400
Enrico and Embelino are too depressed to do anything.

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:02.140
Come and talk to them!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.250
We need a leader right now.

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:06.240
Who, me?

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.020
Romeo!

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:20.560
Everybody says only you can take Alfredo's place as leader.

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:27.130
Alfredo's place...? I can't take Alfredo's place... you know that!!

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:33.520
Don't say that. I don't know what we'll do if you say that.

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:37.140
We need to discuss something.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.170
The funeral.

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:42.100
Funeral?

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:44.150
When I went to the church a while ago,

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:48.140
...the priest asked me what we were going to do with the body.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:53.760
We don't have the money to pay for a gravestone...

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:57.060
No, no!!

00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:00.860
He won't come back if we give him a funeral!

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:03.240
He won't...

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:05.260
Romeo.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:06.700
Romeo.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:10.950
What's wrong with you, Romeo?

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:15.090
Where's all your usual spunk gone, eh?!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.720
I'm sorry... I can't do it.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:31.140
I can't, I can't!!

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:32.270
Romeo!

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:36.450
I can't do it!

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:43.790
Damn...

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:57.080
Hey, Nikita!

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.180
You could at least answer.

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:05.950
I'm depressed too, though I might not look it.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.940
I know without you telling me.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:24.700
I just realized that... it's you I've liked all this time, Nikita!

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:33.500
Drat... Dumped before I even had the chance to ask you out?

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.150
You liked him, right?

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:41.480
So did I...

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.950
...enough to break down crying.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:51.920
I won't give up!
Alfredo fought! And for his life!

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:54.940
I can't...

00:10:57.350 --> 00:11:02.660
Well, I'm going to fight! Like him!

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:03.300
What're you...

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:06.030
Nikita!

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:08.870
The water's cold! You'll kill yourself!

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:11.610
Fight!

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.610
She's right... Fight!

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:21.570
Fight!!

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:36.930
How long are you going to act like a bunch of crybabies?

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.420
And you call yourselves the Black Brothers?

00:11:39.710 --> 00:11:42.510
What happened to you...?
You're all wet.

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.230
You'll catch a cold.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:45.750
So what if I catch a cold!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:48.370
If we don't get off our duffs, we're finished!

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:54.500
Alfredo would never accept us like this. Right?

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:59.130
Let's fight! Let's fight and overcome it.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:03.470
Nikita, can you write?
Take down a letter for me.

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:05.590
A letter? To whom?

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.040
To Romeo.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:20.440
Alfredo's never coming back, Piccolo.

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:30.490
A letter...

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:36.400
"We, the Black Brothers, challenge you, Romeo, to a fight."

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:41.760
"If you lose we will cast you out of the Black Brothers."

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:43.830
Cast me out?

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.990
"If you win, you'll become our new leader."

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:49.580
"You choose: run or fight."

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:57.270
There's Romeo.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:05.250
What did you guys mean by a "fight"? I'm confused...

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.360
I'll tell you.

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:13.030
If you can't face trouble, you don't deserve to be a Black Brother.

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:14.860
I...

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:18.720
If you're going to turn your back on us, then get the hell out!

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:19.980
Get out?

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.200
That's what I said!

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:25.030
How about it! Did you hear me?

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:31.660
What'll it be? We don't accept you as a friend of Alfredo.

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:33.250
Dante...

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.420
You don't have half his courage.

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:40.280
All the time he knew he was going to die,

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:43.450
...he didn't shed a single tear!

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:46.340
Yet Romeo, you...
you're running away!

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:48.260
Running away?

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:51.700
We're all asking you to become our leader.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:54.160
We want you to give us courage and hope.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.170
Like Alfredo.

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:58.180
Like Alfredo!

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:04.300
Still don't get it??

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:11.670
If you don't show some courage, we can't go on!

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:14.580
Stand up. Come on, stand up!

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.450
You coward!

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:25.820
Coward?
- That's right, Romeo.

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:30.070
Why are you still moping around?

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:34.320
My brother always praised you.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:36.990
Romeo...

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.580
...why did Alfredo die with such a peaceful expression on his face?

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:51.890
Because... Romeo...
you believed in him.

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:54.050
Because...

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:02.650
Romeo, he believed in you!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:08.380
He didn't mind leaving us, because he knew you were here.

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:11.860
He was more proud of you than he could bear!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:20.410
Romeo, you really don't get it, do you?

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.800
I'm the one who's depended on you.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.590
You've been my heart's support.

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:30.530
Alfredo.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:39.220
Please stand, Romeo.
For my brother's sake.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:41.350
Come on! Fight, Romeo!

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:42.150
Fight!

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:43.690
Get up!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:46.220
You can do it!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:48.800
Romeo,

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:56.210
I've made it this far because you've been there.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.460
Thank you, Romeo.

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:02.980
No! I don't want to be separated from you!

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:10.250
Romeo, get up! Get up, in my place!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:14.750
We'll always be together, no matter how far apart.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:22.770
We'll always be together, no matter how far apart.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:28.700
Now... get up, Romeo!

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:31.940
Okay, Alfredo.

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:49.810
Bianca, Alfredo is here with me...

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:55.460
I think Alfredo will be with me for the rest of my life.

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:56.120
Romeo...

00:16:56.600 --> 00:17:04.360
I'll... I'll do the things he can't.

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:08.900
Dante, I...

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:12.120
I know how you feel.
You don't have to tell me.

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.610
Thanks, Dante.

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:17.900
Say, Romeo... Hit me.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:21.000
Hit me! Knock me out!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.790
Dante!

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:25.540
Okay, sure!

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.450
Are you okay, Dante?

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.060
That smarts.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:35.710
But now I can stand up too.

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:39.390
Yeah. Yeah!

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:42.650
Will you become our leader, then? We won't take no for an answer now!

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:45.670
Romeo's the only leader for us.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:48.800
Romeo! Romeo!

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:52.940
I'll try. I'll do my best to live up to Alfredo.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.190
You guys'll have to help me.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:56.820
Of course!
- Right!

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:57.680
Right!

00:17:58.080 --> 00:18:00.190
Like Alfredo always said...

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:03.430
There's nothing we can't do if we work together!

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:06.520
Let's celebrate!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.460
Let's not leave it to the adults.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:15.450
Let's give Alfredo a proper burial on our own!

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:17.360
On our own!

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:31.930
<i>And that's how the money to pay for Alfredo's funeral was collected.</i>

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:39.980
<i>Then... on one of those days when the sky is as clear as crystal...</i>

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:46.410
<i>...all those who had loved Alfredo solemnly assembled for his funeral.</i>

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:56.380
Alfredo... This is the book you loved. Take it.

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:13.240
We never had a chance to finish our fight, Alfredo.

00:19:16.370 --> 00:19:19.040
Well... Goodbye, my hero.

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:29.130
Big brother, Mother and Father are waiting for you in Heaven.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:40.880
Our hero, Alfredo. You'll have our trust and respect forever.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:56.200
We're all heroes.

00:19:56.930 --> 00:20:03.380
The whole town's in a fuss.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:10.940
Come on! Let's sing our song.

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:16.900
Every day, every night, covered in soot.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:32.740
It's tough in the chimney, but

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:44.690
Down the hatch! Our courage is burning.

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:51.660
Hey hey, hoi hoi.

00:20:53.240 --> 00:21:00.210
We're all heroes.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:10.210
The whole town's our friend.

00:21:18.440 --> 00:21:23.480
<i>Alfredo, I'm going to live my life so that you'll be proud of me.</i>

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:25.620
<i>We'll be walking together forever.</i>

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:28.880
<i>Forever... forever.</i>

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:36.950
<i>You are hope itself to me, Alfredo.</i>

00:21:56.240 --> 00:22:00.600
<i>The circus has come to town.
To see it, we need 20 lira.</i>

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:03.510
<i>But we don't have any money.</i>

00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:06.620
<i>We need an easy way to get 20 lira quick...</i>

00:22:06.640 --> 00:22:08.540
<i>There must be a way!</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:12.420
See you then!

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:12.420
<i>The Real Treasure</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:12.420
Next time:

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:17.670
<i>"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"</i>

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:30.380
<i>Si Si Ciao, why do the good times</i>

00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:34.680
<i>seem to end so soon?</i>

00:22:34.880 --> 00:22:38.880
<i>Si Si Ciao, we're all friends</i>

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:43.080
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>

00:22:43.690 --> 00:22:47.990
<i>Your laughing voice dances</i>

00:22:47.990 --> 00:22:51.890
<i>Once again in the sky</i>

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:59.190
<i>Your pocket bursting with memories</i>

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:04.790
<i>Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now</i>

00:23:04.990 --> 00:23:08.990
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>
